wf-encounter-name-reaver-dealer = Reaver runner {$designation}
wf-encounter-announce-reaver-dealer = This is {$name}, flying Ashfall colours and holding fire. Clean product and clean sticks, no street cut. Come alongside quiet and you leave with everything you came with.

wf-reaver-dealer-greeting = Hands where I can see them. Good. Now, what are you buying?
wf-reaver-dealer-farewell = Fly careful. Next time we meet I might not be selling.
wf-reaver-dealer-prompt-shop = What are you carrying?
wf-reaver-dealer-response-shop = Full grade, straight off the cookers at Ashfall. Costs what it costs.
wf-reaver-dealer-prompt-who = You're a Reaver. Why aren't you shooting?
wf-reaver-dealer-response-who = The raids pay in hulls. This pays the raids. Start something aboard and you'll see which job the boys prefer.
